      "side": 1,
      "message": "The correct way to filter by plugins is to check the dependency tag. There is no point in using ctx.VisitDirectDepsIf(...) you might as well just use ctx.VisitDirectDeps().\n\nctx.VisitDirectDeps(func(module android.Module) {\n  tag :\u003d ctx.OtherModuleDependencyTag(module)\n  if tag \u003d\u003d pluginTag {\n     patchPaths +\u003d \":\" + strings.Split(ctx.OtherModuleDir(module), \"/\")[0]\n  }\n})\n\nHowever, I\u0027m not sure that you need to do this as the sources are not coming from the annotation processors. I will update the bug with some more info.",
