      "side": 1,
      "message": "The Exported_plugins gets added as dependencies using the exportedPluginTag, they are collected and stored in the java module and accessed using ExportedPlugins(). Any library that depends on a java module calls ExportedPlugins() to get the information it needs to use and adds the plugins to the deps structure\u0027s processorPath/processorClasses fields.\n\nI don\u0027t actually think that this will be necessary as per my comment above but I thought it might prove useful to you in understanding Soong as that pattern is used in lots of places for automatically propagating information through the build.",
